    "detailed_description": "Working zombies in action!<br><br>Kindhearted zombies who get no love just because they're zombies...<br>They work hard to gain the approval of humans!<br><br>Play as four unique professions!<br><br>With over 100 unique stages for you to master!<br>And still more trials await after you've completed them all...?!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flight Attendant</h2><br>Respond to passengers' requests, and help them enjoy a relaxing flight!<br>Make passengers wait and they'll get angry!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nursery School Teacher</h2><br>Respond to the babies' changing moods and make them happy!<br>They'll cry if you don't pay attention to them!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hairstylist</h2><br>Respond to customers' requests, and give them a wonderful new hairstyle!<br>They'll be disappointed if you don't take your job seriously!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plumber</h2><br>Think about how to connect the pipes to get the water flowing!<br>But be careful; there are some pipes the water definitely has to pass through!",
